  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-at-mention",
      "text": "`@` context reference plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web composer: one `@` source searches workspace files, the other references other sessions in the same workspace.\n\n**English** · [中文版](./README.zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **File mentions** — type `@` and a filename to insert a live file path reference.\n- **Session mentions** — type `@` and a session title to reference another session in the same workspace.\n- **Pre-send validation** — referenced files and sessions are checked before sending; stale references block the message with a visible error.\n- **Model context** — mentions are rewritten to readable `@label` spans; snapshot mode injects bounded session snapshots before the user message, while reference mode exposes a scoped `read_session` tool."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "The plugin runs in the `web` profile because it needs the `webServer` service:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-at-mention\ndsh --profile web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-at-mention\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
